---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About Us
description: Learn about Petrobolos Games – our mission and team.
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
  <header class="mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">About Petrobolos Games</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 max-w-3xl">We’re an indie studio focused on crafting engaging experiences. This is placeholder content modeled after the layout of the live site.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 items-start">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Aliquam erat volutpat. Integer et consequat dolor. Donec commodo justo orci, a tempor massa dictum at.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Nulla facilisi. Vestibulum sit amet lorem et urna cursus commodo. Praesent a mi nec neque vestibulum imperdiet. Phasellus venenatis elit vitae nisl vehicula, in mattis dui egestas.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img src="/static/petrobolos-silver.avif" alt="Studio placeholder image" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Our Team</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for i in [1,2,3,4,5,6] %}
      <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200 p-6">
        <img src="/static/petrobolos-silver.avif" alt="Team member placeholder" class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full object-cover">
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Team Member {{ i }}</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Role title</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">Short bio placeholder text for accessibility and layout.</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
